  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FfD Civil society group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Financing for development civil society group under the ECOSOC. The civil society FfD group includes women&#x2019;s groups and contributes to highlighting gender inequalities in the all debates at the UN and in country /regional processes. The mainstreaming and management set up of SID and the project is also sensitive to gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
